# Skirmishers killed in response to its attack trigger: the band it was in comes from its last-known information, so its
# bandmates - Benalish Hero with banding and Memnite as the one member without - still gain first strike, and
# Ornithopter, attacking outside the band, does not (CR 608.2h, 702.22c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Mox Pearl
Icatian Skirmishers
Benalish Hero
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Icatian Skirmishers.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Icatian Skirmishers > Bot2; Benalish Hero > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Benalish Hero; Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Icatian Skirmishers)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Icatian Skirmishers; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Benalish Hero.Keywords = Banding; FirstStrike
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = FirstStrike
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
